{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_041360","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"和母亲分开生活，你不觉得寂寞吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"也还好。<R=同志,COMPA>就像家人一样，而且很多人都来自同一个村子。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=同志,COMPA>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":91,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"也就是说，你有一大堆监护人。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"什么监护人啊！我已经是独当一面的战士了好吗？应该说我们团结得很紧密。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":102,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"抱歉，是这么回事。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"可都因为那个Colibrí，我们被拆散了……不知道大家现在怎么样了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":89,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"喂，Snake。要是看到<R=FSLN,FRENTE>的俘虏，希望你能救救他们。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=FSLN,FRENTE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":80,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"我们的同伴个个都很有韧性。肯定也能帮上MSF的忙。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":""}]}